 COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 국가유공자 본인 및 자녀로 지정받은 후 등록금감면 장학생 신청을 하지</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;않은 학부학생으로서 재학 연한이 초과되지 않은 자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 직전학기 성적 1.6이상(70/100점) 이상인자 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 본인유공자일경우 성적제한없음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;-&nbsp; 신입생 성적제한없음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 장학금액 : 등록금전액 - 장학금 중복수혜 불가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 장학금 지급신청서 1부 (붙임 서식)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 대학수업료면제대상증명서 1부 (주소지 보훈청에서 발급)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 장학금입금통장사본 1부</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">▶ 형제자매 장학금-신규신청자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청대상</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 형제․자매(부모또는부부포함) 2인 이상이 본교에 재학중인 자(대학원 제외) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 직전학기 성적 2.5이상(80/100점) 이상인자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 신입생 성적제한없음 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 장학금액 : 수업료 해당액(2명 모두 수혜대상이 됨) - 장학금 중복수혜 가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 제출서류</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 장학금 지급신청서 1부(붙임 서식)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 주민등록등본 또는 가족관계증명서 1부</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 장학금입금통장사본 1부</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: blue; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">▶ 가계곤란장학금</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청대상 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 소년소녀가장 및 아동복지시설 입소자 및 퇴소자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 국민기초생활보장수급자 및 의료급여수급자 자녀</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 국민기초생활보장법의 차상위계층 대상자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 한부모가족증명서(</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">모․부자가정 증명서 발급가능한자)&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나.&nbsp;성적기준 :</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;직전학기 성적 2.5이상(80/100점) 이상인자</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp; 신입생 성적제한없음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 장학금액 : 기성회비 해당액 - 장학금 중복수혜 불가능</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 제출서류 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 다음 각호 1에 해당하는 서류중 택1</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 아동복지시설수급자 증명서</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 소년소녀가장세대, 고아증명서</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 국민기초생활보장수급자 증명서- 관할동사무소</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 의료급여수급자 증명서- 관할동사무소</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 차상위계층 확인서- 관할행정기관장의 확인서&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 모․부자가정 증명서 - 관할동사무소</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 장학금 지급신청서 1부(붙임 서식)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 주민등록등본 또는 가족관계증명서&nbsp;1부&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4 &nbsp;장학금입금통장사본 1부</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* 기타 문의처 : 054-478-7045</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; COLOR: rgb(40,40,40); LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>2009. 03. 09</strong></font></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>학&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 과&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 장 </strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 한컴바탕\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
